<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  OriginOS Toolkit — monochrome layer for Android 13+ themed icons.

  Themed icons are tinted by the launcher, so this layer has to read as a flat
  silhouette: no gradients, no gloss, one colour. The gloss arcs and the hub
  shading are therefore dropped, and the wrench is kept because it is the part
  of the mark that says what the app does — it crosses the open bore, so it
  stays visible against the transparent hole rather than vanishing into the hub.

  Every shape is a separate <path> on purpose: even-odd cancellation only
  applies within one path, so overlapping silhouettes stay solid.
-->
